POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Gonzalo",
    "lastName": "Erceg",
    "email": "gonzalo@example.com",
    "password": "password123",
      "role": "TEACHER"
}



### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "gonzalo@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Crear examen (reemplazar TOKEN por el JWT del docente)
POST http://localhost:3000/exams
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Primer parcial",
    "description": "Unidades 1 a 3",
    "opensAt": "2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z",
    "closesAt": "2026-11-20T14:00:00.000Z",
    "durationMinutes": 90,
    "maxAttempts": 1,
    "resultsReleaseMode": "MANUAL",
    "showCorrectAnswers": false
}

### Listar exámenes del docente
GET http://localhost:3000/exams
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Detalle de un examen
GET http://localhost:3000/exams/EXAM_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Editar borrador: metadatos, grupos y preguntas
PUT http://localhost:3000/exams/EXAM_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Primer parcial",
    "description": "Unidades 1 a 3",
    "opensAt": "2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z",
    "closesAt": "2026-11-20T14:00:00.000Z",
    "durationMinutes": 90,
    "maxAttempts": 1,
    "resultsReleaseMode": "MANUAL",
    "showCorrectAnswers": true,
    "groupIds": ["GROUP_ID"],
    "questions": [
        { "questionId": "QUESTION_ID", "points": 2, "position": 1 }
    ]
}

### Cerrar
POST http://localhost:3000/exams/EXAM_ID/close
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Liberar resultados a los alumnos
POST http://localhost:3000/exams/EXAM_ID/release-results
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Resultados del examen: intentos y puntajes
GET http://localhost:3000/exams/EXAM_ID/attempts
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Alumno: exámenes disponibles
GET http://localhost:3000/exams/available
Authorization: Bearer STUDENT_TOKEN

### Alumno: detalle del examen (requiere intento en curso)
GET http://localhost:3000/exams/EXAM_ID/student
Authorization: Bearer STUDENT_TOKEN

### Alumno: estado del intento y respuestas guardadas
GET http://localhost:3000/attempts/ATTEMPT_ID
Authorization: Bearer STUDENT_TOKEN

### Alumno: guardar respuesta de opción única
PUT http://localhost:3000/attempts/ATTEMPT_ID/answers/EXAM_VERSION_QUESTION_ID
Authorization: Bearer STUDENT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "optionId": "OPTION_ID"
}

### Alumno: guardar respuesta de opción múltiple
PUT http://localhost:3000/attempts/ATTEMPT_ID/answers/EXAM_VERSION_QUESTION_ID
Authorization: Bearer STUDENT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "optionIds": ["OPTION_ID_1", "OPTION_ID_2"]
}

### Alumno: guardar respuesta de texto
PUT http://localhost:3000/attempts/ATTEMPT_ID/answers/EXAM_VERSION_QUESTION_ID
Authorization: Bearer STUDENT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "text": "Una interfaz HTTP"
}

### Alumno: entregar intento
POST http://localhost:3000/attempts/ATTEMPT_ID/submit
Authorization: Bearer STUDENT_TOKEN

### Alumno: resultado (si fue corregido y liberado)
GET http://localhost:3000/attempts/ATTEMPT_ID/result
Authorization: Bearer STUDENT_TOKEN